# Never upload local secrets. .gitignore already excludes these, but a
# .vercelignore entry is explicit and doesn't depend on that continuing to
# be true — belt and suspenders after NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL's stale local
# value (and this file's real API keys) turned up baked into a production
# build.
.env
.env.local
.env*.local
